              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yon 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Etorrinyuo ninye olpolosie pooki le Israel ebaiki enejing'ieki Hamatoo metabaiki enaiposha e Araba, te risioroto eilo rorei lo Laitoriani, Enkai oo Siraeli, apa oiroro aimunye osinka lenye Yona olayioni le Amitai, ilo oiboni le Nkai; oing'uaa Gat-hafer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etoduaa apa Olaitoriani nchere ore ina kibookinoto e nkop oo Siraeli naa keme, amu meetae hoo obo otelekua, oloena anaa ololakuno, nemeetae oltung'ani oret Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu apa ejo Olaitoriani keiwuang'ie enkarna e Israel tiabori keper. Neaku eitajeuo ninye ninche aitung'uaa enkaina e Yeroboam olayioni le Yoash.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
