          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa nkulie kiaasin e Yeroboam, o nena pooki naataasa ninye, o enkidimata enye, o larrabali lenyena, oina natorrinyoko Israel Dameski o Hamat, naa ene Yuda apa, neigeroki tiatua embuku oo ntepen oo laiguanak le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirura Yeroboam etua anaa apa loo menye, lelo aiguanak le Israel. Neitoreisho Sakaria olayioni lenye te rishata enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.29"
            ]
